/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 113 0 R
/E (Beyond Borders: Shaping Sustainable Futures Together marks a new chapter for the annual RVRC Symposium, expanding into a regional platform for knowledge exchange and collaboration. Bringing together students, educators, and industry partners from Singapore and across Asia, the Symposium explores sustainability and workplace readiness through research, shared experiences, and interdisciplinary dialogue. Organised around two complementary threads, the Symposium encourages participants to exchange perspectives, address real-world challenges, and foster meaningful collaborations towards building a more inclusive, resilient, and sustainable future.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
