/E (Our presentation is on the concept of privilege in relation to race in Singapore. Specifically, we will be focusing within the field of education to provide deeper insight into how racial privilege can be seen in daily life, and because the audience of students will likely be able to relate personal experiences to the topic. We will be looking at this through the concept of intersectionality, e.g. how race and other social identities such as class and religion intersect, and how that creates privileges for certain groups.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
